~ start
Brother Do: [#dynamic_portrait=BrotherDoPortrait]Wassup brother, come to play my carnival game?
- Can I ask about the rules first?
	Brother Do: Sure, here are the rules.
	~ explain_rule
	Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][color=yellow]Rule 1[/color]: Use WASD, not the arrow key, to move.
	Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(false)][color=yellow]Rule 2[/color]: Defend the ball until opponent missed to win.
	Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][color=yellow]Rule 3[/color]: The slider disc move up when you press the up button, and vice versa.
	Brother Do: You got it? Wanna play now?
	- Can you repeat it again?
		Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)][tornado]Haizzz..[/tornado] Ok listen carefully now!
		=> explain_rule
	- I got the rule, let me play.
		=> play_game
	- Yeah, but I don't wanna play anymore.
		Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(false)]...Ok bro.
		Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)]Thanks for [shake]wasting my time[/shake]...
		=> END
- Yes, please!
	~ play_game
	Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)]Ok brother, I will setup the game now. Let's play!
	do GameManager.map_manager.start_minigame("pong")
	if GameManager.last_minigame_won
		Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(false)]Alright brother, you got me. Fair and square.
	else
		Brother Do: [do portrait_with_part.assign_part(true)]Better luck next time, brother!
	=> END
- No
	=> END
=> END